8,0,1,talk,May,,Hi everyone! I'm May. Let's keep things fun and friendly while we figure out who's hiding in plain sight.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm Takumi. I'm not scared. We'll find the werewolf together. Let's stay sharp and watch everyone closely.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
